---
import BmgCircle from "@free-fall/design-system/components/BmgCircle.svelte";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/character-sheet-print.css";

const value = {
  body: { current: 7, base: 12 },
  mind: { current: 6, base: 6 },
  ghost: { current: 1, base: 8 },
};
const examples = [
  { id: "overview", title: "Sheet overview", narrow: false },
  { id: "narrow", title: "In a narrow container", narrow: true },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Character Sheet Row — Layout 1 — FREE//FALL Design System">
  <h1>Character sheet row</h1>
  <p class="variant">Layout 1</p>
  <p>Info and Harm share the smaller column. One BMG circle occupies the larger column beside them. The row stacks when its container runs out of room.</p>

  {examples.map(({ id, title, narrow }) => (
    <section class="specimen breakout" data-example={id} aria-labelledby={`${id}-title`}>
      <h2 id={`${id}-title`}>{title}</h2>
      <div class:list={["example-host", { narrow }]}>
        <div class="char-sheet-row">
          <div class="supporting">
            <section aria-labelledby={`${id}-identity`}>
              <h3 id={`${id}-identity`}>Info / Meta</h3>
              <dl class="identity">
                <div><dt>Callsign</dt><dd>Vantage</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Name</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Operator</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby={`${id}-harm`}>
              <h3 id={`${id}-harm`}>Harm</h3>
              <ol class="harm-slots" aria-label="Harm slots">
                {[1, 2, 3].map((slot) => (
                  <li><span class="slot-number">{slot}</span><span>Empty</span></li>
                ))}
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>
          <div class="primary">
            <BmgCircle {value} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  ))}

  <h2>The proportions</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/content-grid/">prose grid</a>, in reverse: <strong>42.5ch</strong> for the supporting column, then <strong>67ch</strong> for the primary column, with the standard 2rem gap. There is no intermediate narrow-side tier.</p>
  <p>On small containers the order is Info/Meta, Harm, then BMG. The smaller example above uses the same layout inside a 320px host. These are static specimens; the Harm slots show placement, not an editor.</p>

  <h2>Use the row</h2>
  <pre><code>{`<!-- base.css supplies the layout in Astro, Svelte or plain HTML. -->
<div class="char-sheet-row">
  <div>
    <!-- Info / Meta, then Harm -->
  </div>
  <div>
    <!-- One BMG circle -->
  </div>
</div>`}</code></pre>
  <p>Give the row exactly two children, compact first and primary second. In a page-level content grid, use <code>class="char-sheet-row breakout"</code> to make both prose tracks available. The row supplies spacing and proportions; its children supply their own content and presentation.</p>
  <p><a href="/bmg-circle/">BMG Circle</a> · <a href="/character-sheet-static/">Static and print</a></p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: calc(var(--freefall-type-base) * var(--freefall-type-ratio) * var(--freefall-type-ratio) * var(--freefall-type-ratio));
    line-height: calc(7 * var(--freefall-space-1));
  }
  .variant {
    color: var(--freefall-text-muted);
    font: var(--freefall-type-ui-small) / 1.5 var(--freefall-font-mono);
  }
  .specimen {
    min-inline-size: 0;
    margin-block-end: var(--freefall-space-8);
  }
  .example-host { inline-size: 100%; }
  .example-host.narrow { max-inline-size: calc(40 * var(--freefall-space-1)); }
  .supporting { display: grid; gap: var(--freefall-space-4); }
  .supporting > section { padding: var(--freefall-space-2); background: var(--freefall-bg-surface-1); }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--freefall-space-2);
    font-size: calc(var(--freefall-type-base) * var(--freefall-type-ratio));
    line-height: calc(4 * var(--freefall-space-1));
  }
  .identity { display: grid; gap: var(--freefall-space-2); margin: 0; }
  .identity dt { font: var(--freefall-type-ui-small) / 1.5 var(--freefall-font-mono); color: var(--freefall-text-muted); }
  .identity dd { margin: var(--freefall-space-1) 0 0; }
  .harm-slots {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--freefall-space-1);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .harm-slots li {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--freefall-space-1);
    padding: var(--freefall-space-1);
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--freefall-bg-surface-2);
    color: var(--freefall-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--freefall-type-ui-small);
  }
  .slot-number { font-family: var(--freefall-font-mono); color: var(--freefall-text-display); }
  .primary { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-inline-size: 0; }
  @media print {
    .supporting > section, .harm-slots li { background: transparent; color: black; }
  }
</style>
